  "notes": "Diff-derived. At 2.19.0 VerticalResizer is rendered inside the timelineBarsVisible branch of TimelineHeaderRow, so hiding the timeline removes it. The fix at bdb1990aa6 moves it to (timelineBarsVisible || sidePanelVisible). The plan therefore turns on the sidebar detail mode, opens a span detail so the side panel is actually populated, then hides the timeline, which is the exact state the issue screenshots. Contrary to the day-6 brief this entry does NOT start from search results: /trace/<id> is reachable directly, as #3571 and #3804 proved, so hazard H3 does not apply and the view-mode pin is unnecessary here. Locator is the data-testid on VerticalResizer."
